(7458461, 1182233, 33400, '<td valign="top">If Van Gogh and Munch went to the beach together...<br/>Really well done. This meets the challenge and in my poor opinion, rises well above the others.</td>', 'If Van Gogh and Munch went to the beach together...Really well done. This meets the challenge and in my poor opinion, rises well above the others.', '2016-06-03 15:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458462, 1182245, 33400, '<td valign="top">I have that fan.  <br/>It doesn''t do that to me.<br/>Good concept and very well executed.</td>', 'I have that fan.  It doesn''t do that to me.Good concept and very well executed.', '2016-06-03 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458463, 1182226, 33400, '<td valign="top">Everything about this is good - lighting, rule of thirds, black on black shirt.<br/>It stands as a really good portrait. And then you made it meet the challenge exceptionally well.<br/>Had to come back and bump it up.</td>', 'Everything about this is good - lighting, rule of thirds, black on black shirt.It stands as a really good portrait. And then you made it meet the challenge exceptionally well.Had to come back and bump it up.', '2016-06-03 15:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458464, 1182258, 33400, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, but I like it very much.  Colors and use of light and dark make this pop.<br/>I''d hang it on a wall.<br/>Bumping.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, but I like it very much.  Colors and use of light and dark make this pop.I''d hang it on a wall.Bumping.', '2016-06-03 15:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458475, 1182260, 116631, '<td valign="top">Love the photo even tho  no distortions</td>', 'Love the photo even tho  no distortions', '2016-06-03 18:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458527, 1182266, 63218, '<td valign="top">I LOLd. I''m still LOLing. This is wonderful. Love what happened to the teeth...&amp; eyes...&amp; hair. LOL.</td>', 'I LOLd. I''m still LOLing. This is wonderful. Love what happened to the teeth...& eyes...& hair. LOL.', '2016-06-03 21:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458568, 1182268, 63218, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was a lot of fun to PP. Love the colors &amp; the inky blacks. Those 2 little faces are neither one amused--your title is perfect.</td>', 'This looks like it was a lot of fun to PP. Love the colors & the inky blacks. Those 2 little faces are neither one amused--your title is perfect.', '2016-06-04 10:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458606, 1182245, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like the way you handled this, the dramatic PP before you turned on the fan. For some crazy reason it reminds me of Norman Rockwell, what he might be doing if he found himself amongst us here at DPC. Good work.</td>', 'I like the way you handled this, the dramatic PP before you turned on the fan. For some crazy reason it reminds me of Norman Rockwell, what he might be doing if he found himself amongst us here at DPC. Good work.', '2016-06-04 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458607, 1182211, 63218, '<td valign="top">At first I thought ''very cautious, slight distortion.'' Then, I noticed the black halo &amp; the borders &amp; I thought ''oh it''s just the BG that''s been distorted into a creamy blur of color.'' Interesting approach. I think it works.</td>', 'At first I thought ''very cautious, slight distortion.'' Then, I noticed the black halo & the borders & I thought ''oh it''s just the BG that''s been distorted into a creamy blur of color.'' Interesting approach. I think it works.', '2016-06-04 15:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
