(7458712, 1182233, 86447, '<td valign="top">Freaky cool!   I love it!<br/> <br/> <br/>Might be my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Freaky cool!   I love it!  Might be my favorite of the challenge.', '2016-06-05 17:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458714, 1182240, 63218, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t get the areas of flat color, so I missed the almost-symmetry. After a while, I saw the gate. And then I found the other little bits of reality. Then the flat colors looked fine. I''m more &amp; more entertained by what looks like symmetry but isn''t. Symmetry of form &amp; motion, but not detail. So now I love it. Good work.</td>', 'At first I didn''t get the areas of flat color, so I missed the almost-symmetry. After a while, I saw the gate. And then I found the other little bits of reality. Then the flat colors looked fine. I''m more & more entertained by what looks like symmetry but isn''t. Symmetry of form & motion, but not detail. So now I love it. Good work.', '2016-06-05 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458718, 1182209, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like the color, the implied motion, &amp; the promise of symmetry.</td>', 'I like the color, the implied motion, & the promise of symmetry.', '2016-06-05 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458720, 1182254, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is so cute, &amp; so dangerous-looking. Looks like all you had to do was a mirror-flip, &amp; I admire your restraint &amp; knowing when it''s done. Good work.</td>', 'This is so cute, & so dangerous-looking. Looks like all you had to do was a mirror-flip, & I admire your restraint & knowing when it''s done. Good work.', '2016-06-05 18:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458797, 1182254, 182284, '<td valign="top">Nice. It''s definitely one of the top pics.</td>', 'Nice. It''s definitely one of the top pics.', '2016-06-06 00:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
